  "teacher": "targets (training subjects only): ctx30 = mean of dense 6 s features within ±30 s in same trial; subjnorm = per-subject z-scored 6 s features. Ridge(alpha=10, standardized) student maps 6/7 s features -> target; classifier trained on true targets, applied to predicted targets. Threshold from inner-CV full pipeline.",
